From 5029c2a8378a80cbc95d172bf1085ccf5e999ce9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: DroneWuKong <dronewukong@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Mar 2026 00:57:53 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(OrqaF405Pro): remove duplicate IMU SPIDEV, fix README
 battery pins
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

hwdef.dat:
- Removed duplicate SPIDEV imu2 (identical bus/CS as imu1)
- Both IMU driver probes (Invensense + Invensensev3) now reference SPI:imu1
- Added clarifying comment about MPU6000/ICM42688P board revisions

README.md:
- Fixed BATT_VOLT_PIN: 13 → 11 (PC1 = ADC1_CH11)
- Fixed BATT_CURR_PIN: 12 → 13 (PC3 = ADC1_CH13)
- Pin numbers now match hwdef.dat defines
---
 libraries/AP_HAL_ChibiOS/hwdef/OrqaF405Pro/README.md | 4 ++--
 libraries/AP_HAL_ChibiOS/hwdef/OrqaF405Pro/hwdef.dat | 9 ++++-----
 2 files changed, 6 insertions(+), 7 deletions(-)

diff --git a/libraries/AP_HAL_ChibiOS/hwdef/OrqaF405Pro/README.md b/libraries/AP_HAL_ChibiOS/hwdef/OrqaF405Pro/README.md
index 25caa9b..9e227cf 100644
--- a/libraries/AP_HAL_ChibiOS/hwdef/OrqaF405Pro/README.md
+++ b/libraries/AP_HAL_ChibiOS/hwdef/OrqaF405Pro/README.md
@@ -62,8 +62,8 @@ LiPo batteries.
 The correct battery setting parameters are:
 
 - BATT_MONITOR 4
-- BATT_VOLT_PIN 13
-- BATT_CURR_PIN 12
+- BATT_VOLT_PIN 11
+- BATT_CURR_PIN 13
 - BATT_VOLT_MULT 8.3
 - BATT_AMP_PERVLT 92.6
 
diff --git a/libraries/AP_HAL_ChibiOS/hwdef/OrqaF405Pro/hwdef.dat b/libraries/AP_HAL_ChibiOS/hwdef/OrqaF405Pro/hwdef.dat
index caaa3de..0d821ae 100644
--- a/libraries/AP_HAL_ChibiOS/hwdef/OrqaF405Pro/hwdef.dat
+++ b/libraries/AP_HAL_ChibiOS/hwdef/OrqaF405Pro/hwdef.dat
@@ -130,15 +130,14 @@ ROMFS_WILDCARD libraries/AP_OSD/fonts/font*.bin
 
 # Barometer setup
 BARO DPS310 I2C:0:0x77
-        
-# IMU setup
 
-# IMU setup
+# IMU setup — single ICM42688P on SPI1
+# Earlier board revisions may have MPU6000; both drivers probe the same CS pin.
+# Rotation verified against ORQA official PX4 fork (orqafpv/PX4-Autopilot)
 SPIDEV imu1   SPI1 DEVID1 GYRO1_CS   MODE3   1*MHZ   8*MHZ
-SPIDEV imu2   SPI1 DEVID1 GYRO1_CS   MODE3   1*MHZ   8*MHZ
 
 IMU Invensense SPI:imu1 ROTATION_YAW_90
-IMU Invensensev3 SPI:imu2 ROTATION_PITCH_180
+IMU Invensensev3 SPI:imu1 ROTATION_PITCH_180
 DMA_NOSHARE TIM2_UP TIM3_UP SPI1*
 DMA_PRIORITY TIM2_UP TIM3_UP SPI1*
 
-- 
2.43.0

